    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/6ed2ab8e78975dba5475bbd5a008d824.avif?t=1752100351\" data-has-big width=800 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestia is an angelic bullet-hell shoot-'em-up where you defeat enemies throughout the skies, and relax on a floating island with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Mission Mode ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, and collect coins to achieve a higher rank~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/b3d471855747b75f870b5643d326a739.poster.avif?t=1752100351\" width=350 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/b3d471855747b75f870b5643d326a739.webm?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/b3d471855747b75f870b5643d326a739.mp4?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Island Mode ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with friends and pets on your floating island~ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/f1ce0b2bdf20e129602318e4c2b0a835.poster.avif?t=1752100351\" width=350 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/f1ce0b2bdf20e129602318e4c2b0a835.webm?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/f1ce0b2bdf20e129602318e4c2b0a835.mp4?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Music ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks from several indie artists~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/c24543cedb3f7774527ad81d2697aace.poster.webp?t=1752100351\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/c24543cedb3f7774527ad81d2697aace.webp?t=1752100351\" class=\"bb_img\" width=350 height=216 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/6ed2ab8e78975dba5475bbd5a008d824.avif?t=1752100351\" data-has-big width=800 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celestia is an angelic bullet-hell shoot-'em-up where you defeat enemies throughout the skies, and relax on a floating island with your companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Mission Mode ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, and collect coins to achieve a higher rank~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/b3d471855747b75f870b5643d326a739.poster.avif?t=1752100351\" width=350 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/b3d471855747b75f870b5643d326a739.webm?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/b3d471855747b75f870b5643d326a739.mp4?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Island Mode ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with friends and pets on your floating island~ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/f1ce0b2bdf20e129602318e4c2b0a835.poster.avif?t=1752100351\" width=350 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/f1ce0b2bdf20e129602318e4c2b0a835.webm?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/f1ce0b2bdf20e129602318e4c2b0a835.mp4?t=1752100351\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~ Music ~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks from several indie artists~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/c24543cedb3f7774527ad81d2697aace.poster.webp?t=1752100351\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820080/extras/c24543cedb3f7774527ad81d2697aace.webp?t=1752100351\" class=\"bb_img\" width=350 height=216 /></picture></span></p>",
